  "steps": [
    "Boil peas and spinach and blend it with coconut milk and 2 green chillies.",
    "Add olive oil to a pan, along with garlic and onions. Saute until a little brown and add bell peppers and mushrooms (optional)",
    "Cook for a couple of minutes and add seasonings to this.",
    "Now add the coconut base and add sugar and red chilli powder to this along with paneer.",
    "Add water to adjust consistency and let it cook for 15 mins on low flame.",
    "Add olive oil to the pan along with schezwan chutney and a pinch of salt.",
    "Add rice and chopped coriander to this and mix well.",
    "Cook for 2 minutes and it’s ready!"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
